Produce a complete render blueprint for the HTML/CSS rendering engine.

━━━ COLOR PALETTE GUIDANCE ━━━
The `primary` color is used as the cover page background and section divider backgrounds. It should feel topic-appropriate to the tutorial.

The `accent` color is used for callout bars, eyebrow labels, and emphasis.

Choose `primary` and `accent` based on the tutorial category:

  Tutorial category       | primary (cover bg)       | accent
  ─────────────────────── | ─────────────────────── | ─────────────────────
  Web / product build     | #1e2d40  (deep slate)   | #66c2ff  (sky)
  Backend / API systems   | #1a2340  (deep navy)    | #7cc7a3  (mint)
  DevOps / deployment     | #242424  (charcoal)     | #e4b86a  (amber)
  AI / LLM applications   | #2a1f47  (deep violet)  | #8fd0ff  (cyan)
  Default / other         | #1a1a1a  (near-black)   | #b8a97a  (warm gold)

You MUST still return every field in the full color_palette object. The table above guides only `primary` and `accent`; choose suitable light values for `background`, `surface`, `text_primary`, `text_secondary`, and `border` that complement the chosen palette.

Return ONLY the following JSON object. No prose. No markdown. No code fences.

{{
  "blueprint_name": "Render blueprint name",
  "theme": {{
    "color_palette": {{
      "primary": "#hex — dark, topic-appropriate cover background",
      "secondary": "#hex",
      "accent": "#hex — pairs with white text on primary background",
      "background": "#hex",
      "surface": "#hex",
      "text_primary": "#hex",
      "text_secondary": "#hex",
      "border": "#hex"
    }},
    "typography": {{
      "heading_font": "Font name — e.g. 'Inter'",
      "body_font": "Font name — e.g. 'Inter'",
      "mono_font": "Font name — e.g. 'JetBrains Mono'",
      "base_size_px": 14,
      "line_height": 1.6
    }},
    "spacing": {{
      "page_margin_mm": 20,
      "section_gap_px": 48,
      "field_gap_px": 16
    }}
  }},
  "render_directives": [
    {{
      "directive_id": "rd-01",
      "section_id": "sec-01",
      "sequence": 1,
      "template": "cover|toc|domain-overview|worksheet|reference-table",
      "page_break_before": true,
      "slots": [
        {{
          "slot_id": "slot-01",
